      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MORNING DAISY (3) copped a check in the run and finished a well held 20 lengths sixth (25.43) last time in a Grade 5 at this track over 425m. Has the ability and looks a key chance. RED CABANG (8) broke from the inside draw and filled a minor placing last start, beaten only 1.2 lengths (24.48) behind Candy Pops at this track. Expected to be in the finish again. ZIPPING SIGRID (1) was safely held last time out, finishing seventh at Shepparton over 450m behind Chill Out Plate (26.04) in a Grade 5. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Worth following up. IVORY QUILL (2) flew the lids and led all the way last time. Must be respected.",
